{
  "id": "section-742",
  "title": "对《关于×××、×××、×××问题》的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-122.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>122)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　此件已阅，写的可以，是好的。但有骨头，无血肉，感到枯燥无味，则是缺点。望你们在今后几个月内，搞出一个有骨有血有皮有毛的东西出来。要有逻辑有论证，否则仍然是形而上学的东西。十几年来，形而上学盛行，唯物辩证法很少人理，现在是改变的时候了。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-121.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-123.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
